{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>He shall come</b> — this is the king of the north, who is the king of Constantinople, to the glorious land. And the meaning: those who dwell in the place where Edom and Moab and the chief of the children of Ammon were will escape from his hand. And between the days of Sennacherib and this prophecy are many years."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:19.874222405Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}